---
title: "Update default Voice profile"
icon: pencil
description: "Update default Voice profile: updateDefaultVoiceProfile in the TypeScript, Python and Rust clients."
---

`PATCH /v1/projects/{id}/platforms/voice/profiles/default`

Patches the default profile's protocol or mediaEncryption when expectedVersion matches. Omitted fields are preserved. Its server-assigned name is immutable, and directional configuration uses the profileId returned by this resource. Requires platforms:write bound to the path project.

<Tabs>
<Tab title="TypeScript">
```typescript TypeScript
photon.projects.platforms.updateDefaultVoiceProfile(input: UpdateDefaultVoiceProfileInput, options?: RequestOptions): Promise<UpdateDefaultVoiceProfileOutput>
```
</Tab>
