```
</Tab>
<Tab title="Rust">
```rust Rust
client.update_default_voice_profile(id: String, body: &types::UpdateDefaultVoiceProfileRequest).await -> Result<ResponseValue<types::VoiceProfile>, Error<UpdateDefaultVoiceProfileError>>
```
</Tab>
